# Tech Stack Recommender
**DecodeLabs Industrial Training Kit | Batch 2026 | Project 3 — AI Recommendation Logic**

---

## Overview

A content-based filtering recommendation system that maps a user's skills to the best-fit tech career roles using **TF-IDF weighting** and **Cosine Similarity**. Built as the capstone for Project 3 of the DecodeLabs AI track.

