## How to Run

### Option 1 — Browser (index.html)
1. Download all files into one folder
2. Double-click `index.html` to open in browser
3. Type your skills → press `Enter` after each
4. Click **Run Recommender**

### Option 2 — Terminal (recommender.py)
```bash
python recommender.py
```
Requirements: Python 3.x — no external libraries needed (uses only `math` and `csv`)

