## Key Concepts

| Concept | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Content-Based Filtering | Recommends based on item attributes, not user history |
| Cold Start Problem | New user has no history → fixed by asking minimum 3 skills upfront |
| Vector Space Model | Skills mapped to numerical vectors in a shared vocabulary |
| Top-N Filtering | Only highest-scoring matches shown to avoid choice overload |

